    <node id="74ac6f15-820d-4169-baf2-4179475e8855">
      <data key="d0">Residential House Construction Project</data>
      <data key="d6">To build a modern, energy-efficient single-family home that meets all local building codes and provides comfortable living space for a family of four</data>
      <data key="d1">Complete construction of a 2,500 sq ft single-family residence with 4 bedrooms, 3 bathrooms, modern kitchen, living room, dining area, and two-car garage. The project includes site preparation, foundation work, framing, roofing, electrical, plumbing, HVAC installation, interior finishing, and landscaping.</data>
