      <data key="d0">House Construction Project</data>
      <data key="d6">To build a modern, energy-efficient single-family home that meets all building codes and provides comfortable living space for a family of four</data>
      <data key="d1">Complete construction of a 2,500 sq ft single-family home with 4 bedrooms, 3 bathrooms, modern kitchen, living room, dining room, and 2-car garage. The project includes site preparation, foundation work, framing, roofing, electrical, plumbing, HVAC, insulation, drywall, flooring, painting, and landscaping.</data>
